        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ikituruwo Akuj iwon ŋulu ikiyari anakimorikina ka Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paaran sek, itwakito iyes alotai alokiŋaren Akuj aŋuna ka aronis ka aŋuna a ŋasecisya kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin ipotu iyes kiwuapa ŋipitesyo ŋulu ka akwap ŋulu aronok; ipotu iyes kisipukas ekepukan ŋolo epolokinit ŋipyan ŋulu eyakasi kidiama, ekipye ŋolo tokona epolokinit ŋituŋa ŋulu nyiwuapito ŋakiro ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kire, ekwaanae iwon daadaŋ ka ikes, ido ikiboi alotooma ekibure ŋolo a ŋawat yok, etiyao iwon ibore daadaŋ ŋini etalakarit acamit ŋina a ŋawat ka ŋatameta yok a ŋilopeyek. Alokuwane yok a ŋol, ikiya iwon nanyunyura ŋina ka Akuj, ikwapei ŋituŋa ŋuluce daŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai epol nooi akisyon ŋina ka Akuj ka epol nooi amina keŋ ŋina ikiminar iwon: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tari ŋina ikitwakitor iwon alotai alokiŋaren Akuj aŋuna a ŋasecisya yok, abu iŋes ikiinak iwon akiyar kaapei ka Kristo. Toyenutu: erae aŋuna ka ajokis a ŋina ka Akuj ikiunere iyes! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋuna ka akimorikina yok ka Yesu Kristo, abu Akuj ikiteyar iwon kaapei ka Kristo, ido ikisiboik iwon kaapei ka iŋes nakuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Akuj kitiya ŋun akitoodiunia anapakio a daadaŋ a ŋuna eponito, ajokis keŋ ŋina apolon nooi ŋina iloit daadaŋ, ŋina ileere anamina a ŋina abu iŋes kitoodiu neni yok aneni a Yesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anerae erae aŋuna ka ajokis a ŋina ka Akuj ikiunere iyes, aiuno ŋina ipotu iyes toryamut ananupit kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meere aŋuna a ŋiticisyo kus ikiunere iyes, nai erae aiuno ainakinet ŋina ka Akuj, ikotere nyiturokin idiotuŋanan aŋuna ka ainakinet a ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuj iŋes ikiteyakau iwon lopite ŋolo ikiyakar tokona anakimorikina yok ka Yesu Kristo. Adau iŋes asubun iwon nabo alotooma Yesu Kristo, ikotere nai iwon ikitiyae ŋiticisyo ŋulu ajokak, ŋulu aris iŋes kedau akitemonokin kitiyae iwon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emorik Kristo ŋituŋa daadaŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totamunito epite ŋolo paaran sek ayakar akiyar kus; iyes ŋituŋa ŋulu ikidounitoe pa iraakasi Ŋiyudayan, ŋulu ikinyarito Ŋiyudayan “Ŋulu nyikileŋeritae”. Ebasi Ŋiyudayan ŋul ikirae ikes ŋulu ikileŋeritae, anerae iwuapito ikes etal ŋolo ka akileŋeryo ŋawat, lopite ŋolo ileŋeryata ŋituŋa ŋawat kec a ŋileŋia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, pa iyenete iyes Kristo. Iraakasi iyes ŋigelaanotin, nabo pa iraakasi iyes ŋipei ka ŋituŋa ŋulu seuna ŋulu ka Akuj. Pa ikimarakinitae iyes Nacamuneta ŋuna esileereunito ŋakiikineta ŋuna ka Akuj neni a ŋituŋa keŋ, ido iboiyete iyes anakwap a na emam akigeno ka emam ayenut Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilwaka paaran sek iyes aneni ka Akuj, nai aŋuna tokona iyakatar nakimorikina ka Kristo, adaun akitapuun iyes neni ka Akuj aŋuna a ŋaokot a Kristo, aŋuna aponi tobukoroe alomusalaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anerae Kristo elope adau ainun iwon ekisil anakituruwor Ŋiyudayan ka ŋituŋa ŋulu nyerae Ŋiyudayan ŋipei. Anatwanare keŋ alomusalaba, abu Kristo tolema akimananu ŋina sek atyakit ikwa arwatata Ŋiyudayan ka ŋituŋa ŋulu nyerae Ŋiyudayan, ŋina abu kiturubak ikes imanan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes anabunore keŋ kikisa Ŋikisila ŋulu a Ŋiyudayan kaapei ka ŋakiciketa kec, ikotere ituruwori ŋikabilae ŋuluarei ŋul ateker apei ŋina kitete anakimorikina ka iŋes; alopite a ŋol, abu kisisil ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Kristo anatwanare keŋ alomusalaba tolema akimananu a ŋikabilae a ŋuluarei a ŋul ka kituruwo ikes ŋipei anakuwan keŋ a ŋina erae Ŋikristo; ido abu kinyaku ikes neni ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Kristo bu alimonokin ŋakiro ŋuna ke ekisil neni a ŋituŋa a daadaŋ--neni kus a ŋulu nyirae Ŋiyudayan, a ŋulu sek ilwaka nooi aneni ka Akuj ka neni a Ŋiyudayan a ŋulu sek aapiyete aneni ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae aŋuna a Kristo aponere iwon daadaŋ Ŋiyudayan ka ŋulu nyerae Ŋiyudayan, topedorere aponare neni ka Akuj a Papa alotooma Etau ŋolo ka Akuj epei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun nai, nyeriŋa iyes ŋulu nyirae Ŋiyudayan irae ŋigelaanotin kori ŋituŋa ŋulu ka acekwap; irae tokona iyes ŋipei ka ŋituŋa ŋulu ka Akuj ka irae ŋituŋa ŋulu ke epeikal a ŋolo ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isikwaanitae Ŋikristo ka aduketait: aŋun, adaun iyes adukokin nakisyakinet ŋina ka aduketait a ŋina esyakinete ŋikiyakia ka ŋikadwarak. Yesu Kristo elope iŋes erae amoru ŋina itogogoŋit akai alokoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itogogoŋit iŋes aduketait daadaŋ ka itopoloe kituruwo Akai ka Akuj ŋina etyakunitae aŋuna ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alotooma akimorikina ka Kristo, ikidukokin iyes daŋ kaapei ka ŋuluce naduketait ŋina iboiyo Akuj alotooma Etau keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
